flowchart TB
  subgraph Client[User-controlled device]
    App[Mobile app]
    Vault[Hardware-backed vault]
    Prover[Groth16 prover]
  end
  subgraph Identity[Identity trust zone]
    IdAPI[Enrollment and blind issuance]
    Recovery[Recovery]
    Member[Depth-16 membership tree]
    IdDB[(Identity DB)]
    IdKeys[KMS/HSM]
  end
  subgraph Complaint[Complaint trust zone]
    Ingress[Privacy ingress and Tor]
    Verify[Proof verifier]
    Intake[Atomic intake]
    Mail[Mailbox router]
    CDB[(Complaint DB)]
    Obj[(Encrypted evidence)]
    Outbox[Transparency outbox]
  end
  subgraph Handler[Handler organization]
    Portal[Handler portal]
    Safe[Safe evidence viewer]
    HKeys[Organization KMS/HSM]
    Reviewer[Privacy reviewer]
  end
  subgraph Audit[Public audit/community]
    Log[Append-only Merkle log]
    W1[Witness 1]
    W2[Witness 2]
    W3[Witness 3]
    Community[Redacted portal and voting]
    Auditor[Public auditor]
  end
  App -->|identified only| IdAPI
  IdAPI --> IdDB
  IdAPI --> IdKeys
  Recovery --> IdDB
  Member --> IdDB
  Member -->|signed roots/deltas| App
  App -->|anonymous proof and ciphertext| Ingress
  Ingress --> Verify --> Intake
  Intake --> CDB
  Intake --> Obj
  Intake --> Outbox --> Log
  Portal --> CDB
  Portal --> Obj
  Portal --> HKeys
  Portal --> Safe
  Portal --> Reviewer --> Community
  Log --> W1
  Log --> W2
  Log --> W3
  Log --> Auditor
  Community --> Auditor
  App -->|anonymous vote proof| Community
